{"seq":63,"slug":"data-quality-testing","title":"数据质量测试","stage":"DONE","category":"data-science","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-quality-testing","rating":{"composite":4.08,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.8,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4.5,"strategic":4.67},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"数据质量测试\">数据质量测试</h1><p>数据质量测试是将软件工程中成熟的测试方法论引入数据领域的实践——通过声明式规则定义&quot;好数据&quot;的标准，再以自动化手段持续验证数据是否满足这些标准。与传统的手动数据校验不同，现代数据质量测试强调可编程、可版本化、可集成到 CI/CD 与编排系统中，从而在数据生命周期的每个阶段形成防护网。</p>\n<p>本 hub 聚焦数据质量的<strong>测试维度</strong>：如何定义质量规则、选择测试框架、将测试嵌入管道、以及建立运营体系。这与同领域相邻 hub 的分工如下：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>data-governance-lineage</strong>（数据治理与血缘）：关注组织层面的治理政策、元数据管理与数据血缘追踪，属于&quot;管理框架&quot;层面；本 hub 则落到&quot;可执行的测试代码&quot;层面。</li>\n<li><strong>data-drift-model-monitoring</strong>（数据漂移与模型监控）：聚焦特征分布漂移检测与模型性能退化监控；本 hub 覆盖的是管道中更通用的数据完整性与合规性校验。</li>\n<li><strong>schema-evolution-data-contracts</strong>（Schema 演化与数据契约）：侧重 Schema 变更的兼容性策略与契约定义标准；本 hub 则包含 Schema 契约的测试执行与验证集成。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>推荐学习路径：先从「基础理论」章节建立质量维度与架构认知，再进入「框架与工具」掌握 Great Expectations、Soda、dbt 的实操，接着学习「管道集成」将测试嵌入 CI/CD 与流式系统，最后通过「运营」章节理解如何让质量测试持续运转。</p>\n<p>前置知识：SQL 基础、至少一种数据管道工具（Airflow/dbt/Dagster）的使用经验、Python 编程基础。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础理论","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-quality-testing/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"quality-dimensions-metrics","title":"数据质量维度与度量体系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-quality-testing/foundations/quality-dimensions-metrics"},{"seq":2,"slug":"data-profiling-discovery","title":"数据剖析与发现技术","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-quality-testing/foundations/data-profiling-discovery"},{"seq":3,"slug":"quality-architecture-patterns","title":"质量架构与设计模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-quality-testing/foundations/quality-architecture-patterns"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"frameworks-tools","title":"框架与工具","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-quality-testing/frameworks-tools","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"great-expectations-deep","title":"Great Expectations 深度实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-quality-testing/frameworks-tools/great-expectations-deep"},{"seq":2,"slug":"soda-dbt-tests","title":"Soda 与 dbt 数据测试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-quality-testing/frameworks-tools/soda-dbt-tests"},{"seq":3,"slug":"custom-validation-engines","title":"自定义校验引擎设计与构建","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-quality-testing/frameworks-tools/custom-validation-engines"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"pipeline-integration","title":"管道集成","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-quality-testing/pipeline-integration","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"ci-cd-data-testing","title":"CI/CD 中的数据测试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-quality-testing/pipeline-integration/ci-cd-data-testing"},{"seq":2,"slug":"streaming-quality-realtime","title":"流式数据质量实时监控","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-quality-testing/pipeline-integration/streaming-quality-realtime"},{"seq":3,"slug":"schema-contract-testing","title":"Schema 契约测试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-quality-testing/pipeline-integration/schema-contract-testing"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"operations","title":"运营","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-quality-testing/operations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"data-sla-alerting","title":"数据 SLA 与告警体系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-quality-testing/operations/data-sla-alerting"},{"seq":2,"slug":"root-cause-remediation","title":"根因分析与修复策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-quality-testing/operations/root-cause-remediation"},{"seq":3,"slug":"quality-culture-process","title":"质量文化与流程建设","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-quality-testing/operations/quality-culture-process"}]}]}